WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.470
Leave a seedling on a sunny
windowsill for a few days.

2
00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:06.890
Come back, and it's leaning
over towards the glass.

3
00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:09.250
It has no legs to turn itself round,

4
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.450
and it can't twist to face
the light the way you can.

5
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.170
Yet somehow, it has bent.

6
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:18.390
So how does a plant
bend towards the light?

7
00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:21.760
In this mission, you'll meet
auxin, a plant hormone.

8
00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:25.710
You'll see where auxin ends up
when light comes from one side,

9
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.390
and what it does to the cells there.

10
00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:31.310
And you'll find out how plants
respond to gravity as well as

11
00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:32.390
light.

12
00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:36.820
Your mission: explain how a
seedling bends towards the light.
